{"name":"persuasion_choose_mul_choose_le_two","v":1,"source_hash":"c4bc52498ab89567","lines":["m u t : ℕ","hu : 2 ≤ u","hum : u ≤ m","ht : 1 ≤ t","htu : t + 1 ≤ u","⊢ u.choose t * (2 * m - u).choose (m - t) ≤ 2 * (2 * (m - 1)).choose (m - 1)","u t : ℕ","k : ℕ","hum : u ≤ k + 1","⊢ u.choose t * (2 * (k + 1) - u).choose (k + 1 - t) ≤ 2 * (2 * (k + 1 - 1)).choose (k + 1 - 1)","⊢ m = m - 1 + 1","t : ℕ","k u' : ℕ","hu : 2 ≤ u' + 1","htu : t + 1 ≤ u' + 1","hum : u' + 1 ≤ k + 1","⊢ (u' + 1).choose t * (2 * (k + 1) - (u' + 1)).choose (k + 1 - t) ≤ 2 * (2 * (k + 1 - 1)).choose (k + 1 - 1)","⊢ u = u - 1 + 1","t' : ℕ","ht : 1 ≤ t' + 1","htu : t' + 1 + 1 ≤ u' + 1","⊢ (u' + 1).choose (t' + 1) * (2 * (k + 1) - (u' + 1)).choose (k + 1 - (t' + 1)) ≤","    2 * (2 * (k + 1 - 1)).choose (k + 1 - 1)","⊢ t = t - 1 + 1","hN : 2 * (k + 1) - (u' + 1) = 2 * k + 1 - u'","⊢ 2 * (k + 1) - (u' + 1) = 2 * k + 1 - u'","hmt : k + 1 - (t' + 1) = k - t'","⊢ k + 1 - (t' + 1) = k - t'","hk : k + 1 - 1 = k","⊢ k + 1 - 1 = k","⊢ u'.choose t' * (2 * k + 1 - u').choose (k - t') + u'.choose t'.succ * (2 * k + 1 - u').choose (k - t') ≤","    2 * (2 * k).choose k","N : ℕ := 2 * k + 1 - u'","hN : 2 * (k + 1) - (u' + 1) = N","hNdef : N = 2 * k + 1 - u'","⊢ u'.choose t' * N.choose (k - t') + u'.choose t'.succ * N.choose (k - t') ≤ 2 * (2 * k).choose k","h2 : u'.choose t' * N.choose (k - t') ≤ (2 * k).choose k","⊢ 1 ≤ u'","⊢ 1 ≤ N","⊢ u' + N = 2 * k + 1","⊢ t' ≤ k","h1 : u'.choose (t' + 1) * N.choose (k - t') ≤ (2 * k).choose k","⊢ u'.choose (t' + 1) * N.choose (k - t') ≤ (2 * k).choose k","s1 : u'.choose (t' + 1) = u'.choose (u' - t' - 1)","⊢ u'.choose (t' + 1) = u'.choose (u' - t' - 1)","⊢ u' - t' - 1 = u' - (t' + 1)","⊢ t' + 1 ≤ u'","s2 : N.choose (k - t') = N.choose (k - (u' - t' - 1))","⊢ N.choose (k - t') = N.choose (k - (u' - t' - 1))","⊢ k - (u' - t' - 1) = N - (k - t')","⊢ k - t' ≤ N","⊢ u'.choose (u' - t' - 1) * N.choose (k - (u' - t' - 1)) ≤ (2 * k).choose k","⊢ u' - t' - 1 ≤ k","⊢ u'.choose t' * N.ch